class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2ir2:"><div data-rid="32f242b9-5a21-4dcc-9150-c57e11135d77" class="r-134c2de"><div data-rid="497e0632-c284-4e8f-b75d-ac281070ee8e" class="r-hecsak alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Multivitamin is suitable for dogs of all ages and breeds. However, we do recommend dogs begin to incorporate the chews into their daily routine starting at an age of 3 months or older.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="69a51e5f-ec7f-4053-b68f-e4fb43a1154a" class="r-1k4ho24" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0749bfcd-9cd8-453b-9ff0-2e5e33294803" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3ir2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-98k370"><div data-rid="29dfb24c-ef3f-4e74-ab30-2a9dae32cddb" class="r-v6pz8p alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What does 100% Human-Grade mean? </p></span></div><div data-rid="1459a99e-050e-4834-afb9-c6deadc96bed" class="r-13yzk5k"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3ir2:"><div data-rid="48dc399c-7166-4f3e-91ee-0da6fc4e8ff3" class="r-2ep2lu"><div data-rid="e12ab6cd-a534-412e-a66a-234f6c38498c" class="r-1qd0yjd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most pet supplements from other brands contain palm oil, fillers, artificial flavoring, preservatives, etc. At VitalPaws, we’re raising the standards of pet health by only using the highest quality human-grade ingredients, which is what our best friends deserve.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0556c9a0-70ae-41d9-bb75-7b699310f05e" class="r-j31238" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="483d6fb3-a304-4c50-a8ea-227a658d9c0c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4ir2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-109y9nu"><div data-rid="6160b95b-a496-4db7-83b2-59dba493375f" class="r-4bns8p alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long until I start seeing the benefits?</p></span></div><div data-rid="56fc5af6-c97e-4803-8742-4d419f491d67" class="r-1y5nwon"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4ir2:"><div data-rid="82ce1d73-1f6e-4034-ab53-a89d036d424b" class="r-irwr5p"><div data-rid="5823fe1f-3b85-426c-9c1b-ce1125a9c650" class="r-leojw0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="eec2729e-8c0c-4c01-9947-a44adf3daac6" class="r-tsnpii" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="522d2029-80e1-4870-9db4-d8d3b3fd4633" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5ir2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-179c9w7"><div data-rid="5cb282ca-a8d8-45d4-b351-7872c76b7d91" class="r-2y9n7f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How many chews come in a jar? </p></span></div><div data-rid="b0d406ba-19a9-46e7-a9bc-9494e284cedd" class="r-18qltdi"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5ir2:"><div data-rid="ced87250-71b6-43aa-b183-708521823540" class="r-18mmtpt"><div data-rid="2b842cc6-a2c9-49ef-a2a3-b87cefd95f76" class="r-1ovfsli alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There are <strong>60 Chews in each jar</strong>, which is a 2-month supply for Small Dogs (0-12kg). <br>Medium dogs (12-34kg) will need a monthly frequency. <br>Bigger dogs (34kg+) will need a 3-weekly frequency.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="10fa7c80-fe14-40b4-bcb2-93d61d764a60" class="r-i6p5c4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="17fd50c2-c57a-4c6a-aabf-a077a6dc1121" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6ir2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-exbtf6"><div data-rid="b90d7cf6-84f3-4b60-a2f8-f8e023e8b00f" class="r-1s8ff06 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What flavour is the Multivitamin?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f3ce3cf9-f35f-4ca2-9e80-ae0c29a54f03" class="r-67ixuo"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R6ir2:"><div data-rid="0303a200-1fc5-4b51-85c4-ad615b74d41a" class="r-1jvno1y"><div data-rid="833e7c29-fe44-4556-9686-3dcfc9937823" class="r-1wgko54 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade chicken liver, a flavor that dogs absolutely love. In the case of a chicken allergy, we recommend our Beef flavour!</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6709e5e8-93dc-4e94-8c0e-117d4b9eba29" class="r-4lswyg" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="813669ad-1ad9-4116-b652-8e473d533a65" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7ir2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-qo7yr2"><div data-rid="017137d3-3849-4ac4-9a19-9fccd9a4bd8a" class="r-ybu0t6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews? </p></span></div><div data-rid="e5f024f7-745f-4f7f-a8c5-dd287a72cc94" class="r-1g8t8v9"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7ir2:"><div data-rid="0aa53f83-d96f-484d-b28c-1368907651a6" class="r-1pxf61x"><div data-rid="c55c6bc9-9a49-41a3-86db-bc315e68eb1d" class="r-5bpfqo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ea8e03d7-5790-41d8-b4d0-2a1d3751dfff" class="r-dlehk1" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4fdccfb4-3803-43b7-b19d-a2f84f4bd749" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R8ir2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1b6z7nk"><div data-rid="7a788b9f-43ad-442b-80ae-ca6829c60a57" class="r-7sl0yf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements? </p></span></div><div data-rid="f19c95c3-4974-4f1c-a065-5287338bcf74" class="r-1x3khk"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R8ir2:"><div data-rid="0750eab2-928b-4a84-b399-0ea2b1798fae" class="r-1qp3g86"><div data-rid="0a613728-dcfa-4f1f-8884-3b4bf419691c" class="r-f63s1m alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}
    <script  type="application/json" id="replo-deps-template-product">
    {"id": "{{ product.id }}","handle": "{{ product.handle }}","data":{{ product | json }}}
    </script>
  <script type="application/json" id="replo-deps-products">
    [{"id": "{{ product.id }}","handle": "{{ product.handle }}","data":{{ product | json }}}, {"id":"9938029117706","handle": "vitalpaws-multivitamin-chews","data":{{ all_products['vitalpaws-multivitamin-chews'] | json }}}]
  </script>
  {%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.featured_media
      assign seo_media = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.featured_media
    else
      assign seo_media = product.featured_media
    endif
  -%}
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "http://schema.org/",
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": {{ product.title | json }},
      "url": {{ request.origin | append: product.url | json }},
      {% if seo_media -%}
        "image": [
          {{ seo_media | image_url: width: 1920 | prepend: "https:" | json }}
        ],
      {%- endif %}
      "description": {{ product.description | strip_html | json }},
      {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku != blank -%}
        "sku": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku | json }},
      {%- endif %}
      "brand": {
        "@type": "Brand",
        "name": {{ product.vendor | json }}
      },
      "offers": [
        {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
          {
            "@type" : "Offer",
            {%- if variant.sku != blank -%}
              "sku": {{ variant.sku | json }},
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if variant.barcode.size == 12 -%}
              "gtin12": {{ variant.barcode }},
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if variant.barcode.size == 13 -%}
              "gtin13": {{ variant.barcode }},
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if variant.barcode.size == 14 -%}
              "gtin14": {{ variant.barcode }},
            {%- endif -%}
            "availability" : "http://schema.org/{% if variant.available %}InStock{% else %}OutOfStock{% endif %}",
            "price" : {{ variant.price | divided_by: 100.00 | json }},
            "priceCurrency" : {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
            "url" : {{ request.origin | append: variant.url | json }}
          }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ]
    }
  </script>
{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<script type="application/json" id="replo-deps-shopify-store">{ "shop": { "moneyFormat": {{ shop.money_format | json }}, "moneyWithCurrencyFormat": {{ shop.money_with_currency_format | json }} } }</script>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}